# AB-022: Mixing pH values is not taking their arithmetic mean
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 50mL
add v1 HCl 0.0005mol
measure v1 ph
new
add v2 water 50mL
add v2 HCl 0.000005mol
measure v2 ph
new
mix v1 1 v2 1 into v3
measure v3 ph
inspect
